From 554d0cd57242a7f14c862ca3fdd8c9211cf07a72 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 09:40:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] hub admission tests: sibling suites import
 hub_admission_support, not test_kanban_hub_admission

Follow-up to PR #1890's review (5888719492). Move locked() into
tests/hermes_cli/hub_admission_support.py and point the guards, sampler_read,
gate_convoy, grant_echo, scopes and turns suites at it. The suites that used the
shared board fixture now declare their own over support.open_board, so no test
module imports another. Test-only.
---
 tests/hermes_cli/hub_admission_support.py     | 18 ++++++++++++---
 tests/hermes_cli/test_kanban_hub_admission.py | 12 +---------
 .../test_kanban_hub_admission_grant_echo.py   |  2 +-
 .../test_kanban_hub_admission_guards.py       | 22 ++++++++++---------
 .../test_kanban_hub_admission_sampler_read.py | 10 +++++----
 .../test_kanban_hub_admission_scopes.py       |  2 +-
 .../test_kanban_hub_admission_turns.py        |  2 +-
 .../hermes_cli/test_kanban_hub_gate_convoy.py |  9 +++++---
 8 files changed, 43 insertions(+), 34 deletions(-)

diff --git a/tests/hermes_cli/hub_admission_support.py b/tests/hermes_cli/hub_admission_support.py
